ecord_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1122501003:1":{"text":"不少人都去找他打听过，但这个人脾气古怪，好像又收了流沙之爪的贿赂，半个字也没透露。","source_cn":"不少人都去找他打听过，但这个人脾气古怪，好像又收了流沙...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0D1407493978078","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1122501004:1":{"text":"可惜我不方便亲自出面，打探情报的事，只能交给你了。","source_cn":"可惜我不方便亲自出面，打探情报的事，只能交给你了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x77E8BFD16328038C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"可惜我不方便亲自出面，打探情报的事，只能交给你了。","female":"可惜我不方便亲自出面，打探情报的事，只能交给你了。","variant_male_record_index":"128723","variant_female_record_index":"128724","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:银喙":{"text":"银喙","source":"银喙","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/cn/ep1/quest_story/11225020.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11225020","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11225020","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1122502001:1":{"text":"又是来打听流沙之爪的，唉，真烦。","source_cn":"又是来打听流沙之爪的，唉，真烦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38605C864A238E8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1122502002:1":{"text":"要是百物牌玩得比我还好，我就告诉你！","source_cn":"要是百物牌玩得比我还好，我就告诉你！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7DAD0BD9144F1569","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"要是百物牌玩得比我还好，我就告诉你！","female":"要是百物牌玩得比我还好，我就告诉你！","variant_male_record_index":"128726","variant_female_record_index":"128727","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人以西戈":{"text":"商人以西戈","source":"商人以西戈","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/cn/ep1/quest_story/11225030.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11225030","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11225030","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:0:1122503001:0":{"text":"行吧行吧，愿赌服输。流沙之爪往<style=\"highlight\">咸水镇南边</style>去了。","source_cn":"行吧行吧，愿赌服输。流沙之爪往<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18E64A44FAC8F25D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1122503002:0":{"text":"嘿……就是不知道你们现在过去，他们还在不在了。","source_cn":"嘿……就是不知道你们现在过去，他们还在不在了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EC63506220CF9AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人以西戈":{"text":"商人以西戈","source":"商人以西戈","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/cn/ep1/quest_story/11225040.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11225040","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11225040","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:0:1122504001:0":{"text":"饶了我们吧！那些事都是鲁弗斯让我们做的！","source_cn":"饶了我们吧！那些事都是鲁弗斯让我们做的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29D232BAAD9799EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1122504002:0":{"text":"他、他猜到那个商人嘴巴不严，就自己躲到<style=\"highlight\">咸水镇北边的山上</style>去了！","source_cn":"他、他猜到那个商人嘴巴不严，就自己躲到<style=h...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF93B88B873F0A44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:流沙之爪小喽啰":{"text":"流沙之爪小喽啰","source":"流沙之爪小喽啰","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/cn/ep1/quest_story/11225050.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11225050","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11225050","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:0:1122505001:0":{"text":"什——什么人？！","source_cn":"什——什么人？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3DBDB2094198019","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1122505002:0":{"text":"可恶，那帮不中用的家伙，居然敢出卖我！","source_cn":"可恶，那帮不中用的家伙，居然敢出卖我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AE2DB86D6F159DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:流沙之爪鲁弗斯":{"text":"流沙之爪鲁弗斯","source":"流沙之爪鲁弗斯","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/cn/ep1/quest_story/11225060.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11225060","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11225060","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1122506001:1":{"text":"……都清理干净了？！这么快！","source_cn":"……都清理干净了？！这么快！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFAD